{
    "title": "Dallas Cowboys",
    "description": "Welcome to the official mobile app of the Dallas Cowboys. Make your phone a unique part of your game-day experience, with access to the latest breaking news, real-time stats, videos on demand and so much more. Now you can stay in-the-know at any time, anywhere.Features include:\r\n- News: Real-time breaking news from the Cowboys, previews of upcoming matchups, post-game blogs.\r\n- In-stadium: Enjoy in-seat ordering, custom content and engagement opportunities, and more.\r\n- Video: Live and video-on-demand clips of the Cowboys\u2019 press conferences, coach and player interviews.\r\n- Photos: Galleries of game action, practice, and community events.\r\n- Audio: Podcasts of exclusive Cowboys content.\r\n- Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league.\r\n- Standings: Division and conference standings.\r\n- Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams.\r\n- Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games and events.\r\n- Tickets: Access your tickets for game day directly in the app.Follow us @dallascowboys on Twitter for updates or visit www.dallascowboys.com.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see About Nielsen Measurement  for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the official mobile app of the Dallas Cowboys. Make your phone a unique part of your game-day experience, with access to the latest breaking news, real-time stats, videos on demand and so much more. Now you can stay in-the-know at any time, anywhere.Features include:<br>- News: Real-time breaking news from the Cowboys, previews of upcoming matchups, post-game blogs.<br>- In-stadium: Enjoy in-seat ordering, custom content and engagement opportunities, and more.<br>- Video: Live and video-on-demand clips of the Cowboys\u2019 press conferences, coach and player interviews.<br>- Photos: Galleries of game action, practice, and community events.<br>- Audio: Podcasts of exclusive Cowboys content.<br>- Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league.<br>- Standings: Division and conference standings.<br>- Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams.<br>- Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games and events.<br>- Tickets: Access your tickets for game day directly in the app.Follow us @dallascowboys on Twitter for updates or visit www.dallascowboys.com.<br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see About Nielsen Measurement  for more information.",
